.DS_Store

# Agent-tool state written into the working tree, machine-local by convention. Named here so
# the exclusion belongs to the repository rather than to one machine's global ignore file — a
# second Gardener cloning this repo gets it too (E-021). Only the .local.json is excluded:
# a shared .claude/settings.json is repo content and stays gated like anything else.
.claude/settings.local.json
